Chapter: NoAliasLinearParam

 A declared linear parameter is unaliased within its function body by
 the ownership discipline. Stage 0 of NoAliasCodegen surfaces that fact
 at emit time as the CDX4011 info diagnostic on memory accesses whose
 base is the linear owner. This test pins the whole carrier chain: the
 LinearTy wrapper must survive the registered signature, deep-resolve,
 and lowering into IRDef unique-params, or the diagnostic never fires
 and the diag sidecar fails the battery.

Section: Types

  Point = record {
   x : Integer,
   y : Integer
  }

Section: Use

  point-x : linear Point -> Integer
  point-x (p) = p.x

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni (integer-to-text (point-x (Point { x = 7, y = 9 })))
  end
